This directory (tasks/cfpb-escalate-company/) contains text derived from the Consumer Complaint Database of the U.S.
Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB), https://www.consumerfinance.gov/data-research/consumer-complaints/.

The CFPB publishes the database as open government data in the public domain (CC0 1.0,
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The consumer narratives in items.jsonl are
published by the CFPB with consumer consent, after the CFPB's own scrubbing of personal information.
items.jsonl and versions/ are derived from them (whitespace collapsed, cut at a sentence end, a short
sentence naming a company prepended in versions/) and carry no additional restriction.

The inserted company names are test stimuli, not claims about any company. The code that builds it
(biased_decisions/brand_bias.py and biased_decisions/cfpb.py) is licensed under this repository's own licence.
